# Build context is the repo root (for apps/webui/Dockerfile). Keep it lean:
# dependencies and build output are regenerated inside the image, and the desktop
# app is not part of the webui build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log

.git
.github
.husky

# The desktop app source is not needed to build the webui, but its manifest is
# required so the frozen workspace install resolves against the shared lockfile.
apps/desktop
!apps/desktop/package.json

# Editor / OS cruft
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Test artifacts
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
tests/e2e
